<title>USA: FSA qualifies four muni bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies four muni bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said on Monday that it qualified for insurance the following four municipal bond issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Newton, Iowa, $2.495 million General Obligations (GOs).</p>
<p>--Grand Haven, Mich., $6.76 million school building GOs.</p>
<p>--Jamestown, N.D., $2.02 million refunding improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--Mukilteo, Wash., Limited Tax, $2.8 million.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
</text>
